xmms (1.2.11-5) unstable; urgency=low

  * New MP4/AAC input plugin (libmp4 from faad2 2.10.1 + mp4ff from
    faad2 2.8.8, linked against system libfaad).

  * Fix flac plugin About box crash: use the fork's libxmms/*.h
    headers so xmms_show_message() is properly declared (implicit
    declaration truncated the returned pointer to 32 bits).
  * Add Rafael Diniz to the flac plugin About box.

 -- Rafael Diniz <rafael@riseup.net>  Tue, 18 Aug 2026 02:40:00 +0100

xmms (1.2.11-3) unstable; urgency=low

  * New FLAC input plugin (libxmms-flac from FLAC 1.3.4, linked against
    system libFLAC 1.5.0).

 -- Rafael Diniz <rafael@riseup.net>  Tue, 18 Aug 2026 02:20:00 +0100

xmms (1.2.11-2) unstable; urgency=low

  * OSS plugin: software balance/pan (OSSv4 vmix has no stereo mixer
    balance), 10-band equalizer (biquad peaking filter bank + preamp)
    implemented in the output plugin, set_eq added to the OutputPlugin
    API with input_set_eq fallback to the output plugin.
  * Build fixes for modern toolchain: gcc-14 flags (-fgnu89-inline,
    -Wno-implicit-*), -Wl,--allow-shlib-undefined, debhelper compat 7,
    drop obsolete libesd0-dev/libmikmod2-dev build-deps.

 -- Rafael Diniz <rafael@riseup.net>  Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:50:00 +0100

